# Patch branches applied onto the upstream base, in order, to build the
# integration branch. One branch name per line; blank lines and # comments
# ignored. Order matters when patches touch the same files.
#
# Edit this to enable/disable a patch, then run tools/fork/apply-patches.sh.
# Document every entry in PATCHES.md.

patch/mari-unsandboxed-shell
patch/capability-relink-node-modules
patch/fork-upstream-diagnostics
patch/ambient-sky
# Must stay after patch/ambient-sky: same files, and applying the fix last
# makes a lost hunk a loud conflict instead of a silent regression.
patch/weather-resize-repaint
patch/impersonate-copy-button
patch/fork-tooling
